Topshiriq variantlari:

1. Faza siljishini ko'rsatish

Fazasi turlicha bo'lgan ikkita signalni qurib taqqoslang.

% Parametrlar

A = 1;

f = 2;

Fs = 50;

t = 0:1/Fs:1;

% Fazali signallar

x1 = A * sin(2*pi*f*t);

x2 = A * sin(2*pi*f*t + pi);

y = x1+x2;

% Grafik

stem(t, x1, 'b', 'filled'); hold on;

stem(t, x2, 'r', 'filled'); hold on;

stem(t, y, 'g', 'filled');

title('Fazasi turlicha bolgan sinusoidal signallar');

xlabel('n');

ylabel('x[n]');

legend('phi = 0', 'phi = \pi');

grid on;

2. Variant 2:

Bir nechta davriy signallar kombinatsiyasi

Ikkita davriy signal yig'indisini hosil qiling:

x[n]=sin(2πf1n)+0.5⋅cos(2πf2n)

% Parametrlar

Fs = 500;

t = 0:1/Fs:1;

f1 = 2;

f2 = 7;

x = sin(2*pi*f1*t);

y = 0.5*cos(2*pi*f2*t);

z = x+y;

% Grafik

stem(t, x, 'b', 'filled'); hold on;

stem(t, y, 'r', 'filled');

stem(t, z, 'g', 'filled');

title('Bir nechta davriy signallar yigindisi');

xlabel('n');

ylabel('x[n]');

grid on;

